@startuml sequence-diagram
autonumber
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"

actor "Pengguna (Trader)" as User
participant "Omen Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Phantom EVM Wallet" as Wallet
participant "PredictionMarket.sol" as Contract
participant "Supabase API Route" as Backend
database "Supabase DB" as DB
actor "Admin" as Admin

== 1. Pemasangan Taruhan (Betting) ==
User -> Frontend : Pilih Sisi (Yes/No) & Input Nominal ETH
Frontend -> Wallet : Minta Sign & Send `placeBet(marketId, side)`
Wallet -> Contract : Broadcast Tx dengan Native ETH
Contract --> Wallet : Tx Hash Konfirmasi
Wallet --> Frontend : Tx Success
Frontend -> Backend : POST `/api/bets/index` (txHash, marketId, amount, side)
Backend -> DB : Simpan ke tabel `bets` & `points_events`
Backend -> DB : Tambah total_points di `users`
Backend --> Frontend : Status Berhasil & Poin Bertambah

== 2. Resolusi Pasar ==
Admin -> Frontend : Buka `/admin` -> Pilih Market -> Input Hasil (Yes/No)
Frontend -> Wallet : Sign `resolveMarket(marketId, result)`
Wallet -> Contract : Broadcast Tx Resolusi
Contract --> Wallet : Market Resolved Event
Frontend -> Backend : POST `/api/markets/:id/resolve` (status)
Backend -> DB : Update status di tabel `markets`

== 3. Klaim Kemenangan (Claim Payout) ==
User -> Frontend : Buka "My Bets" -> Klik "Claim Payout"
Frontend -> Wallet : Minta Sign `claim(marketId)`
Wallet -> Contract : Eksekusi `claim(marketId)`
Contract -> User : Transfer Payout Native ETH ke Wallet
Contract --> Wallet : Payout Sent Event
Frontend -> Backend : Update status `claimed = true` di DB

@enduml
